Move to 7-Zip-JBinding 23.01-2.2.

16.02-2.01 compiles in 7-Zip 16.02, whose archive decoders have published
memory-safety bugs, CVE-2018-10115 in RAR among them. 23.01-2.2 carries
7-Zip 23.01 behind the same Java API. Its jar names the macOS directory
"Mac" rather than "Mac-x86_64".

Upstream: not submitted
Applies-to: all environments

